scripts/get_nauty.sh downloads nauty from its official distribution points and
builds it locally. No nauty source is redistributed here. src/automorph_serial_col.c
is original work that includes nauty's public headers and links against its
library, in the manner nauty is intended to be used.

If you use GraphCrunch in published work, cite nauty as well. The canonical
reference is

    B. D. McKay and A. Piperno, Practical graph isomorphism, II,
    Journal of Symbolic Computation 60 (2014), 94-112.
